👑🧠 Birbal and the Mango Tree (Raw Story)

One day, two men came to Emperor Akbar with a problem.

They both claimed ownership of a mango tree.

One man said, “I planted the tree and took care of it.”

The other said, “No, it is mine!”

Akbar was confused and asked Birbal for help.

Birbal thought for a while and made a plan.

He told a guard to inform both men, “The mango tree has been stolen during the night.”

The first man looked worried and said, “Oh no! My tree!”

He rushed to check it immediately.

The second man said calmly, “That’s not my problem.”

Birbal smiled.

He said, “The real owner is the one who cared enough to worry.”

Akbar agreed and gave the tree to the first man.

💖 Moral:

The true owner is the one who truly cares.
